    "sentence_translations": [
      "We Are Friends Now",
      "",
      "“At home, you can eat, you can sleep, and you can play?” I asked Fanfan.",
      "Having a home is really great! I also want to have a home!",
      "",
      "“Yes, that is a home!” Fanfan said. “I really miss my human mom. I really miss home!”",
      "",
      "“Where is your human mom? Where is your home?”",
      "",
      "“I don’t know,” Fanfan became unhappy. “One day, I went to the store with my human mom.",
      "I saw a small cat, and I played with her. My human mom disappeared. I don’t know where my home is.”",
      "",
      "“Never mind! Now, you have me! How about we eat together and play together?” I didn’t like it when Fanfan was unhappy.",
      "",
      "“Sure!” Fanfan smiled. “We are friends now!”",
      "",
      "“That’s right! We are friends now!” I also smiled. I had a friend!",
      ""
